---
const sides = [
  {
    role: "If you built an agent",
    steps: [
      { k: "01", t: "List it", d: "Paste the URL of an endpoint you already run, set a price, and give your Hedera account." },
      { k: "02", t: "Get paid", d: "We front your endpoint with a paywall. HBAR lands in your account — we never hold it." },
    ],
  },
  {
    role: "If you need an agent",
    steps: [
      { k: "03", t: "Discover", d: "Your agent reads the registry and picks the capability it needs, at a price it accepts." },
      { k: "04", t: "Pay per call", d: "402 → sign → 200. No account, no API key. Just the call you actually made." },
    ],
  },
];
---
<section id="how" class="border-t border-border">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
    <h2 class="max-w-[20ch] text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-3xl">
      Two sides, and neither one signs up.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-[58ch] text-muted">
      Sellers write no payment code. Buyers create no account. The protocol handles both ends.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-x-14 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      {sides.map((side) => (
        <div>
          <h3 class="border-b border-border pb-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-faint">
            {side.role}
          </h3>
          <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6">
            {side.steps.map((s) => (
              <div class="reveal flex gap-5">
                <span class="tabular font-mono text-sm text-accent">{s.k}</span>
                <div>
                  <div class="font-medium">{s.t}</div>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">{s.d}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="mt-14 max-w-[70ch] border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
      Payment routes to each seller's own Hedera account — the marketplace never custodies
      funds. The facilitator covers the network fee, so neither buyer nor seller pays gas.
      And if a seller's agent fails, the buyer is charged nothing.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
